{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALREADY PLAYED BY 1,000,000+ HEROES WORLDWIDE \u2014 NOW ON STEAM!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years of updates, thousands of crafted weapons, countless epic battles \u2014 <i>Battlesmiths: Blade &amp; Forge</i> finally comes to Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your town, forge powerful gear, lead your squad into epic PvP and PvE battles \u2014 and prove you are the mightiest battlesmith in the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/0b67747d11cb77e4113b8ed6c124f532.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/0b67747d11cb77e4113b8ed6c124f532.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/0b67747d11cb77e4113b8ed6c124f532.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE FORGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Battlesmiths</i>, gear isn\u2019t loot \u2014 it\u2019s the result of your labor. Weapons and armor are crafted by you and directly affect how your heroes look and fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons, armor, and powerful runes.\u00a0Enchant armor to customize your squad. Customize the appearances of every hero the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experiment with builds, enhance gear, and create combinations no enemy can predict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/690a78a75801b80f95c2f985e2b972be.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/690a78a75801b80f95c2f985e2b972be.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/690a78a75801b80f95c2f985e2b972be.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAD YOUR HEROES TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of heroes, picking their classes, gear and runic abilities. Every loadout impacts movement, damage, and attack speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight semi-automatic battles that reward both smart preparation and sharp tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/503ed1eda3c21809ac7eb9052293f74c.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/503ed1eda3c21809ac7eb9052293f74c.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/503ed1eda3c21809ac7eb9052293f74c.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD &amp; UPGRADE YOUR TOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade buildings, expand your facilities, and unlock new crafting options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your town is the heart of your power \u2014 protect it and make it flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/bf4f12f598a022d31cb7c3509ef729bc.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/bf4f12f598a022d31cb7c3509ef729bc.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/bf4f12f598a022d31cb7c3509ef729bc.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLANS AND EPIC BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join a clan or create your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive bosses, share resources and help your teammates grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/42947aedc7504db926f4028de2ec24cf.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/42947aedc7504db926f4028de2ec24cf.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/42947aedc7504db926f4028de2ec24cf.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVENTS AND CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Daily quests, regular events, unique limited-time rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There\u2019s always a new goal to strive for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/25dcdcefc34e957c0d4ae550f7d6e2a5.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/25dcdcefc34e957c0d4ae550f7d6e2a5.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/25dcdcefc34e957c0d4ae550f7d6e2a5.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL PC EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Battlesmiths</i> on Steam delivers the full experience without compromise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/8833e9d4c3456d8f6cf1501db38a01a1.poster.avif?t=1758724045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/8833e9d4c3456d8f6cf1501db38a01a1.webm?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/8833e9d4c3456d8f6cf1501db38a01a1.mp4?t=1758724045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and be among the first to forge your legend on Steam!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2583940/20a7a37a1733b58865234d2afb896272d6da0ada.jpg"},{"name":"Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2583940/20a7a37a1733b58865234d2afb896272d6da0ada.jpg"},{"name":"Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2583940/20a7a37a1733b58865234d2afb896272d6da0ada.jpg"},{"name":"Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2583940/20a7a37a1733b58865234d2afb896272d6da0ada.jpg"},{"name":"Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2583940/20a7a37a1733b58865234d2afb896272d6da0ada.jpg"},{"name":"Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2583940/20a7a37a1733b58865234d2afb896272d6da0ada.jpg"},{"name":"Beginners are lucky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.